{
	"name": "Exorcism",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/magic/symbols/runes-etched-steel-blade.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As an action, you begin reciting a prayer or mantra that binds and burns nearby otherplanar entities. Choose a fey, fiend, or undead within 15ft, including any that are possessing a creature. That target must make a Charisma saving throw or be stunned until you end this effect. At the end of each of the creature’s turns, they may attempt a saving throw to end the effect early. If you or an ally deal damage to the target, the effect ends immediately unless you sprinkle holy water or press cold iron to the target’s flesh in order to deal the damage. You must spend your action each round reciting the prayer or mantra to maintain this effect which can last for up to 1 minute. If you successfully maintain the effect for the full minute, your target is exorcised from your current plane to the nearest appropriate plane.</p>",
